Default keyboard.dispatch to keyCode on mobile virtual keyboards.

Android soft keyboards routinely leave KeyboardEvent.code empty or wrong,
which breaks keybindings and the tab key when dispatching by code.

Index: code-server/lib/vscode/src/vs/platform/keyboardLayout/common/keyboardConfig.ts
====================================================================
--- code-server.orig/lib/vscode/src/vs/platform/keyboardLayout/common/keyboardConfig.ts
